<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Formosa Chemicals H1 profit down.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Formosa Chemicals H1 profit down.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    20,088 vs 21,002</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     911 vs  1,962</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			1,164 vs  2,545</p>
<p>NOTE -</p>
<p>Formosa Chemicals and Fibre Corp is one of Taiwan's</p>
<p>leading chemical fibre makers.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
